
// Returns all available categories and their unique values (gender, color, newArrival, discount)
GET http://localhost:3001/products/categories HTTP/1.1

###

// Returns most important information about all products with no filters (price, color, name, id, gender)
GET http://localhost:3001/products HTTP/1.1

###

// Returns only products filtered where color is Blue (price, color, name, id, gender)
GET http://localhost:3001/products?color=Blue HTTP/1.1

###

// Returns only products filtered where gender is Men (price, color, name, id, gender)
GET http://localhost:3001/products?gender=Men HTTP/1.1

###
// Returns products filtered matching both gender and color, accepts several filtering values at the same time
GET http://localhost:3001/products?gender=Men&color=Blue&color=Red&gender=Women HTTP/1.1

###
// Returns only products filtered matching both gender Men and color Blue
GET http://localhost:3001/products?gender=Men&color=Blue

###
// Returns all details for a single product by ID (id = 3)
GET http://localhost:3001/products/3 HTTP/1.1

